('2026/27','submitted',null,null,'Selorm Boateng','selorm.boateng0@example.test','+233211678443','+233226434414','female','2001-12-04',600,'University of Ghana','Radiography and Medical Imaging','66629388',null,57.8,'North East','Ahafo','[{"language":"Ewe","level":"basic"},{"language":"Gonja","level":"conversational"},{"language":"Hausa","level":"fluent"}]'::jsonb,ARRAY['Community outreach','Health communication','Market outreach']::text[],'none',12,false,ARRAY['Video editing','Content creation','Graphic design']::text[],'I have seen how often good health information does not reach the people who need it most, and I want to help change that. In my community I have watched relatives rely on rumours about illness when a few clear facts would have helped them act sooner. Joining the club would let me build real skills in health communication and outreach while working alongside people who care about the same things. I am ready to give my time, learn from mentors and carry what I learn back to the people around me.','I have seen how often good health information does not reach the people who need it most, and I want to help change that. In my community I have watched relatives rely on rumours about illness when a few clear facts would have helped them act sooner. Joining the club would let me build real skills in health communication and outreach while working alongside people who care about the same things. I am ready to give my time, learn from mentors and carry what I learn back to the people around me.','I have seen how often good health information does not reach the people who need it most, and I want to help change that. In my community I have watched relatives rely on rumours about illness when a few clear facts would have helped them act sooner. Joining the club would let me build real skills in health communication and outreach while working alongside people who care about the same things. I am ready to give my time, learn from mentors and carry what I learn back to the people around me.','I plan my week around my timetable, so I would set aside fixed evenings for club work and keep weekends for outreach when they are scheduled. I am used to balancing lectures with other duties, and I would be honest with the team if a busy exam period meant I needed to step back for a short while.','A lecturer or my department',now(),now() - interval '2 days'),
